{"4189640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Feed The Maw", "steam_appid": 4189640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/3db8eccd6941cb63b110917f67ebe8ae.avif?t=1786679673\" width=700 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somewhere in the middle of the sea, a giant beast sleeps near your island. Every so often, it wakes up hungry. If you don't prepare a feast for it, you become the feast... 💀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/49b14ca0390e32d3dfd1cfc2afe047c4.webp?t=1786679673\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/1a757382ea5e8bd0532a526efb9d6165.poster.avif?t=1786679673\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/1a757382ea5e8bd0532a526efb9d6165.webm?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/1a757382ea5e8bd0532a526efb9d6165.mp4?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You and 5 other islanders will need to work together to survive until the end. If your fellow islander fall, pick up their mask so they will continue living! If your fellow islander is not doing enough, you can always sacrifice them to the Maw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/c18f68545140018e0844ff6b696256b6.webp?t=1786679673\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/488cdce3020f34e1d99a6895aafbc851.poster.avif?t=1786679673\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/488cdce3020f34e1d99a6895aafbc851.webm?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/488cdce3020f34e1d99a6895aafbc851.mp4?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Search around the island for fruits, vegetables &amp; mushrooms! You'll need to choose whether to give it to the beast, or eat it yourself though because you'll get hungry as well ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/d2c9440e4ee46822112407e12929123a.webp?t=1786679673\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/e4dc02af805f3aca07ca3bf8d8dce475.poster.avif?t=1786679673\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/e4dc02af805f3aca07ca3bf8d8dce475.webm?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/e4dc02af805f3aca07ca3bf8d8dce475.mp4?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are numerous hostile creatures that would be happy eating a human. So it's up to you whether to hunt or be hunted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/256df70f1ba376d4e30968042d21c6e6.webp?t=1786679673\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/09855504a50755fa1e8c1f76d5bf025f.poster.avif?t=1786679673\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/09855504a50755fa1e8c1f76d5bf025f.webm?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/09855504a50755fa1e8c1f76d5bf025f.mp4?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The mysterious island works very... mysteriously. Every week for some unknown reason it changes. Each path, each area is different so you will need to adapt to the new surroundings every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/14e4dd949ce33523dd4ad8fa2d10d02a.webp?t=1786679673\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/d2f9e54d02fe17f922bc01dd5eb5affe.poster.avif?t=1786679673\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/d2f9e54d02fe17f922bc01dd5eb5affe.webm?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/d2f9e54d02fe17f922bc01dd5eb5affe.mp4?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The beast is hungry so don't wait until its patience has run out! You'll need to make sure, all your food are enough before the time runs out. Be wary though, the more dark it gets, the more dangerous island creature will spawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/bab0315379e7303b2575f6a545635b47.webp?t=1786679673\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/7f8a6359df35ac894e3b8528af382b13.poster.avif?t=1786679673\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/7f8a6359df35ac894e3b8528af382b13.webm?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/7f8a6359df35ac894e3b8528af382b13.mp4?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">FEED. THE. MAW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will also be able to</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics and change up your appearance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools to fight off island creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect achievements and add them as your tattoo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pray to the ancestors to gain special power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink island brews to enhance your abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the catapult <span class=\"bb_strike\">for fun</span> to explore the island</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many more &quot;islandy&quot; stuff awaits. So get moving and find food before the time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/3db8eccd6941cb63b110917f67ebe8ae.avif?t=1786679673\" width=700 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somewhere in the middle of the sea, a giant beast sleeps near your island. Every so often, it wakes up hungry. If you don't prepare a feast for it, you become the feast... 💀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/49b14ca0390e32d3dfd1cfc2afe047c4.webp?t=1786679673\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/1a757382ea5e8bd0532a526efb9d6165.poster.avif?t=1786679673\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/1a757382ea5e8bd0532a526efb9d6165.webm?t=1786679673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189640/extras/1a757382ea5e8b